msgstr "XLIFF podaci premašuju sigurnosno ograničenje od 5 MB."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:375
msgid "The attachment changed after Vision review. Run the review again."
msgstr "Privitak je promijenjen nakon Vision pregleda. Ponovite pregled."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-site-plan.php:254
msgid ""
"The connected Yablonsky AI text route must pass the current live canary "
